comment: [PROMOT note] [RD-CDM] Graefe, A.S.L., Hübner, M.R., Rehburg, F. et al. An ontology-based rare disease common data model harmonising international registries, FHIR, and Phenopackets. Sci Data 12, 234 (2025). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-04558-z
comment: Consanguinity has a major role in congenital and genetic diseases.
