name: Fatigable faiblesse des muscles du cou {babelon:translation_language="fr", babelon:source_value="Fatigable weakness of neck muscles", babelon:comment="label of HP:0030199 (Fatigable weakness of neck muscles)  ; abnormality of the nervous system ; abnormality of the musculature", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", babelon:source_language="en"}
name: Fatigable weakness of neck muscles
name: Fatigable weakness of neck muscles 
def: "A type of weakness of a skeletal muscle in the neck that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of strength with repetitive muscle actions." [HPO_CONTRIBUTOR:UK_rheller]
