[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032013
name: Difficulty changing basic position
name: Difficulté à passer d’une position de base à une autre
name: Dificultad para cambiar las posturas corporales básicas {comment="ICF:150502901, translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "A difficulty to change basic position, i.e. a difficulty getting into and out of a body position and moving from one location to another, such as getting up out of a chair to lie down on a bed, and getting into and out of positions of sitting, standing, kneeling or squatting. This is distinct from the difficulty of transferring oneself." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:150502901"}
def: "Difficulté à prendre et quitter une position et/ou à passer d'un endroit à un autre, comme se lever d'un fauteuil pour se coucher sur un lit, et comme prendre et quitter les positions assise, debout, à genoux ou accroupie. Cette difficulté est distincte de la difficulté à se transférrer." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:150502901", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Dificultad para adoptar o abandonar una postura, pasar de un lugar a otro, como levantarse de una silla para tumbarse en una cama, y adoptar o abandonar posiciones determinadas, como arrodillarse o sentarse en cuclillas. Es distinta de la dificultad para transferir el propio cuerpo." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:150502901, translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
is_a: HP:0100022 ! Anomalie des mouvements
is_a: PROMOT:0032003 ! Phénotype lié à une activité
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 ICF:150502901 ! affects Changing basic body position
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: PROMOT:1000001 "[OPMD Scoping review 2026] Bélair N, Gagnon C, Duchesne E. What is known about muscle weakness, balance impairments and indoor mobility limitations in oculopharyngeal muscular dystrophy? A scoping review. J Neuromuscul Dis. 2025 Dec 30:22143602251397052. doi: 10.1177/22143602251397052. Epub ahead of print. PMID: 41467981." xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032014
name: Difficulty walking short distance
name: Difficulté à marcher sur de courtes distances
name: Dificultad para andar distancias cortas {comment="ICF:150502901, translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "A difficulty to walk for less than a kilometre, such as walking around rooms or hallways, within a building or for short distances outside. This is distinct from the difficulty of moving around." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:555410497"}
def: "Difficulté à avancer à pied, sur une distance de moins d'un kilomètre, comme marcher dans sa chambre ou dans le couloir, dans un bâtiment ou sur de courtes distances à l'extérieur." [] {IAO:0000119="ICF:555410497", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Dificultad para andar menos de un kilómetro, como caminar por habitaciones y pasillos, dentro de un edificio o pequeñas distancias en el exterior. Es distinta de la dificultad para desplazarse por el entorno" [] {babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", IAO:0000119="ICF:555410497, translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772"}
is_a: HP:0001288 ! Gait disturbance
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 ICF:555410497 ! affects Andar distancias cortas
