[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032018
name: Fatigabilité des muscles extra-occulaires provoquant une ptose {babelon:translation_status="CANDIDATE"}
name: Fatigable ptosis
name: Ptosis fatigable {babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", comment="translation by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772"}
def: "A type of ptosis that occurs after the external ocular muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is a ptosis apparition with repetitive external ocular muscle actions." [] {comment="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-8470", IAO:0000119="Clinical experts"}
def: "Tipo de ptosis que aparece tras el uso de la musculatura extrínseca ocular y disminuye con el reposo del grupo muscular. Es decir, se produce la aparición de ptosis con la realización repetida de movimientos de la musculatura extrínseca ocular." [] {IAO:0000119="translation by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Une fatigabilité des muscles extra-occulaires qui provoque une ptose" [] {babelon:translation_status="CANDIDATE"}
is_a: HP:0000508 ! Ptosis
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 PROMOT:0032029 ! affects Resistencia del músculo extraocular
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: PROMOT:1000001 "[Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review] \"Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial\" initiative, European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases, https://www.promotinitiative.com/" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032019
name: Debilidad fatigable muscular axial {comment="translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigabilité des muscles axiaux {comment="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigable weakness of axial muscles
def: "A type of weakness of the axial muscles (i.e., of the muscles of the head and neck, vertebral column, and intercostal muscles) that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the axial muscles with repetitive muscle actions." [] {comment="[PROMOT project] Mansoore Gholizade (definition reviewer)", IAO:0000119="HP:0003473"}
def: "Una debilidad del músculo axiales, es decir, los músculos de la cabeza y el cuello, la columna vertebral y las costillas, que se manifiesta cuando un grupo muscular axial está bajo presión y que disminuye después de que el grupo en cuestión ha sido puesto en reposo. En resumen, se trata de una disminución de la fuerza del músculo axiales como resultado de una carga repetida." [] {IAO:0000119="Translated from French using Reverso. translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Une faiblesse des muscles axiaux, c.à.d. des muscles de la tête et du cou, de la colonne vertébrale et des côtes, qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire axial est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles axiaux à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée." [] {babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", IAO:0000119="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847"}
is_a: HP:0030197 ! Faiblesse fatigable des muscles squelettiques
property_value: IAO:0000117 "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927" xsd:string
property_value: PROMOT:1000001 "[Congenital myasthenic syndrom Scoping review] \"Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial\" initiative, European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases, https://www.promotinitiative.com/" xsd:string
property_value: PROMOT:1000001 "[Congenital myopathy Scoping review] \"Performing a Rare Disease-Oriented Master Observational Trial\" initiative, European Joint Programme on Rare Diseases, https://www.promotinitiative.com/" xsd:string

[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032020
name: Debilidad fatigable de la musculatura facial  {comment="translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigabilité de la musculature faciale {comment="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigable weakness of facial musculature
def: "A type of weakness of the facial musculature (i.e. one or more muscles innervated by the seventh cranial nerve) that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the facial musculature with repetitive muscle actions." [] {comment="[PROMOT project] Mansoore Gholizade (definition reviewer)", IAO:0000119="HP:0003473"}
def: "Una debilidad de la musculatura facial, es decir, uno o varios músculos que están inerbidos por el séptimo nervio craneal, que se manifiesta cuando un grupo muscular facial está bajo presión y que disminuye después de que el grupo en cuestión ha sido puesto en reposo. En resumen, se trata de una disminución de la fuerza del músculo faciales como resultado de una carga repetida." [] {IAO:0000119="Translated from French using Reverso. translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Une faiblesse de la musculature faciale, c.à.d. d’un ou plusieurs muscles inervés par le septième nerf cranial, qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire facial est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles faciaux à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée." [] {babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", IAO:0000119="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847"}
is_a: HP:0003473 ! Myasthénie
is_a: PROMOT:0032003 ! Phénotype lié à une activité
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 ICF:1328675264 ! affects Comer
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 PROMOT:0032030 ! affects Endurance d’un muscle du visage
relationship: PROMOT:2000001 PROMOT:0032066 ! affects Power of facial muscle
