[Term]
id: PROMOT:0032021
name: Debilidad fatigable del músculo oculares {comment="translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigabilité des muscles occulaires {comment="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
name: Fatigable weakness of the ocular muscles
def: "A type of weakness of the ocular muscles that occurs after a muscle group is used and lessens if the muscle group has some rest. That is, there is diminution of the strength of the ocular muscles with repetitive muscle actions." [] {comment="[PROMOT project] Mansoore Gholizade (definition reviewer)", IAO:0000119="HP:0003473"}
def: "Una debilidad del músculo oculares que se manifiesta cuando un grupo muscular ocular está bajo presión y que disminuye después de que el grupo en cuestión ha sido puesto en reposo. En resumen, se trata de una disminución de la fuerza del músculo oculares como resultado de una carga repetida." [] {IAO:0000119="Translated from French using Reverso. translation reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7764-2085 and https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3391-9772", babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL"}
def: "Une faiblesse des muscles occulaires qui se manifeste quand un groupe musculaire occulaire est sollicité et qui diminue après que le groupe en question a été mis au repos. En résumé, il s’agit d’une diminution de la force des muscles occulaires à la suite d’une sollicitation répêtée." [] {babelon:translation_status="OFFICIAL", IAO:0000119="translated from English by https://orcid.org/0009-0000-5160-7927 reviewed by https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2829-847"}
